    cannot be used as Link Material, also send the remaining cards to the GY. You
    can target 1 Plant monster in your GY that has a Level; the Levels of monsters
    this card points to become that monster''s Level, until the end of this turn.
    You can only use each effect of "Sylvan Dancepione" once per turn.'
